{"v":[{"a":["وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","ذَاتِ","ٱلۡبُرُوجِ"],"t":"By the sky with the constellations","l":"Wa As-Sama'i Dhati Al-Buruji","w":[["wal-samāi","By the sky"],["dhāti","containing"],["l-burūji","the constellations"]]},{"a":["وَٱلۡيَوۡمِ","ٱلۡمَوۡعُودِ"],"t":"And by the Promised Day","l":"Wa Al-Yawmi Al-Maw`udi","w":[["wal-yawmi","And the Day"],["l-mawʿūdi","Promised"]]},{"a":["وَشَاهِدٖ","وَمَشۡهُودٖ"],"t":"And by the witness and the witnessed","l":"Wa Shahidin Wa Mash/hudin","w":[["washāhidin","And (the) witness"],["wamashhūdin","and what is witnessed"]]},{"a":["قُتِلَ","أَصۡحَٰبُ","ٱلۡأُخۡدُودِ"],"t":"Destroyed were the People of the Trench","l":"Qutila 'Ashabu Al-'Ukhdudi","w":[["qutila","Destroyed were"],["aṣḥābu","(the) companions"],["l-ukh'dūdi","(of) the pit"]]},{"a":["ٱلنَّارِ","ذَاتِ","ٱلۡوَقُودِ"],"t":"The fire supplied with fuel","l":"An-Nari Dhati Al-Waqudi","w":[["al-nāri","(Of) the fire"],["dhāti","full"],["l-waqūdi","(of) the fuel"]]},{"a":["إِذۡ","هُمۡ","عَلَيۡهَا","قُعُودٞ"],"t":"While they sat around it","l":"Idh Hum `Alayha Qu`udun","w":[["idh","When"],["hum","they"],["ʿalayhā","by it"],["quʿūdun","(were) sitting"]]},{"a":["وَهُمۡ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","يَفۡعَلُونَ","بِٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","شُهُودٞ"],"t":"And were witnessing what they did to the believers","l":"Wa Hum `Ala Ma Yaf`aluna Bil-Mu'uminina Shuhudun","w":[["wahum","And they"],["ʿalā","over"],["mā","what"],["yafʿalūna","they were doing"],["bil-mu'minīna","to the believers"],["shuhūdun","witnesses"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","نَقَمُواْ","مِنۡهُمۡ","إِلَّآ","أَن","يُؤۡمِنُواْ","بِٱللَّهِ","ٱلۡعَزِيزِ","ٱلۡحَمِيدِ"],"t":"They begrudged them only because they believed in God the Almighty, the Praiseworthy","l":"Wa Ma Naqamu Minhum 'Illa 'An Yu'uminu Billahi Al-`Azizi Al-Hamidi","w":[["wamā","And not"],["naqamū","they resented"],["min'hum","[of] them"],["illā","except"],["an","that"],["yu'minū","they believed"],["bil-lahi","in Allah"],["l-ʿazīzi","the All-Mighty"],["l-ḥamīdi","the Praiseworthy"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِي",